{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "07ZM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$T \\subset X$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}' \\subset \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$T$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-sections-supported-on-closed-subset}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-subsheaf-sections-supported-on-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4254da34eaf473e9b3e8dbf0386d1ca4f718d4d604a4489b73be7439495c3531", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8270dd0057ab794b2f9616d5c8f10cc7969ea02ed61d91e5a42f2574f86386bf", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a closed subset whose complement\nis retrocompact in <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0005>-module.\nThe quasi-coherent subsheaf <MATH_0006> defined in\nLemma <REF_0001> is called\nthe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>subsheaf of sections supported on <MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b30e18a8a3ad1693610533187165b61f11716c563dd3abe14cda4226c9b72ac6", "unit_id": "tag:084L:statement"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07ZM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$Z \\subset Y$", "MATH_0003": "$Y \\setminus Z$", "MATH_0004": "$Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}' \\subset \\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}Z$", "MATH_0009": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}' \\subset f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0010": "$Z$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-push-sections-supported-on-closed-subset}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e9aa2737d69ef6e95ef129a5c8d3dcde3e9c99e8299b959d4824e2c1b1401aab", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:95eb5a82ed009600520d46796a891b551276333e897336d76d117b991820d229", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated morphism\nof schemes. Let <MATH_0002> be a closed subset such that\n<MATH_0003> is retrocompact in <MATH_0004>. Let <MATH_0005> be a quasi-coherent\n<MATH_0006>-module. Let <MATH_0007>\nbe the subsheaf of sections supported in <MATH_0008>.\nThen <MATH_0009> is the subsheaf\nof sections supported in <MATH_0010>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ef1e38731d7204aa8d5bf52581658ccf53f62afcac06e38c477184c8abb7650d", "unit_id": "tag:07ZQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "07ZM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\setminus f^{-1}Z$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$Y \\setminus Z$", "MATH_0004": "$Y$", "MATH_0005": "$f^{-1}Z$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "$Z$", "MATH_0010": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-sections-supported-on-closed-subset}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-sections-supported-on-closed-subset}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:468b8fc2f3332ddc95d3b354b7113392c7176fd73734d856a75b3cac3147b015", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:65aebe392687b84f2abd8501a70764a7f9a7a5c5b841150608cbea0c9aa17d78", "source_text": "Omitted. (Hint: First show that <MATH_0001> is retrocompact\nin <MATH_0002> as <MATH_0003> is retrocompact in <MATH_0004>. Hence\nLemma <REF_0001>\napplies to <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006>. As <MATH_0007> is quasi-compact and\nquasi-separated we see that <MATH_0008> is quasi-coherent.\nHence Lemma <REF_0002>\napplies to <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010>. Finally, match the sheaves\ndirectly.)\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e2abcc7333498da9f5299b16997031e4cabb324393119647319892a1021e87d1", "unit_id": "tag:07ZQ:proof"}
